    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins developed a relentless obsession with the Egg. They\u2019re drawn to it by something they can\u2019t explain - and stopping simply isn\u2019t an option anymore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's big. It's mysterious. They must break it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your squad from a variety of goblin classes, each with unique skills and roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/4bd61c74639bb7276432cccccc603ac6.poster.avif?t=1749659556\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/4bd61c74639bb7276432cccccc603ac6.webm?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/4bd61c74639bb7276432cccccc603ac6.mp4?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Rich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/3d9117c2df3780e1e2ab68c2c5376799.poster.avif?t=1749659556\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/3d9117c2df3780e1e2ab68c2c5376799.webm?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/3d9117c2df3780e1e2ab68c2c5376799.mp4?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick wisely from a variety of upgrades that shape your village and goblin forces. Boost productivity, discover new units, or unlock new mechanics. Every choice matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/42aad0b648a5bf404f549c1b1adc828a.poster.avif?t=1749659556\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/42aad0b648a5bf404f549c1b1adc828a.webm?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/42aad0b648a5bf404f549c1b1adc828a.mp4?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prestige - Meta progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do it again! Customize your future runs with unique abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/40d6f54d888de45eb709e71ef665776a.poster.avif?t=1749659556\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/40d6f54d888de45eb709e71ef665776a.webm?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/40d6f54d888de45eb709e71ef665776a.mp4?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins developed a relentless obsession with the Egg. They\u2019re drawn to it by something they can\u2019t explain - and stopping simply isn\u2019t an option anymore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's big. It's mysterious. They must break it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your squad from a variety of goblin classes, each with unique skills and roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/4bd61c74639bb7276432cccccc603ac6.poster.avif?t=1749659556\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/4bd61c74639bb7276432cccccc603ac6.webm?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/4bd61c74639bb7276432cccccc603ac6.mp4?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Rich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/3d9117c2df3780e1e2ab68c2c5376799.poster.avif?t=1749659556\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/3d9117c2df3780e1e2ab68c2c5376799.webm?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/3d9117c2df3780e1e2ab68c2c5376799.mp4?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick wisely from a variety of upgrades that shape your village and goblin forces. Boost productivity, discover new units, or unlock new mechanics. Every choice matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/42aad0b648a5bf404f549c1b1adc828a.poster.avif?t=1749659556\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/42aad0b648a5bf404f549c1b1adc828a.webm?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/42aad0b648a5bf404f549c1b1adc828a.mp4?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prestige - Meta progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do it again! Customize your future runs with unique abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/40d6f54d888de45eb709e71ef665776a.poster.avif?t=1749659556\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/40d6f54d888de45eb709e71ef665776a.webm?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/40d6f54d888de45eb709e71ef665776a.mp4?t=1749659556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
